{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ku4WNemb7U6ivjJC638Gtx","type":"tool_result","content":"example | writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing | Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force]\nnew | creates one Task-Spec scaffold and derived state | Usage: taskspec new [--format 3|4] [--status ready|blocked] [--queue] <slug> <XS|S|M|L|XL|XXL> [agent] [source-note]\nplan | none | Usage: taskspec plan --manifest <TaskPlan.yaml>\nbatch | creates declared Task-Spec scaffolds; --dry-run writes nothing | Usage: taskspec batch --plan <TaskPlan.yaml> | taskspec batch --intent-file <file> --effort <size>\ngate | executes task evals; --stamp additionally writes the sign-off envelope | Usage: taskspec gate [--stamp] [--require-tier1] <task-spec>\naccept | executes acceptance evals; --stamp additionally writes AcceptanceRecord/v1 and the acceptance envelope | Usage: taskspec accept [--stamp] [--handoff <file>] [receipt flags] <task-spec>\nstatus | none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command | Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id>\ndecompose | Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation. | Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\ndecompose init | Create explicit intent workspace. | Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\ndecompose prepare | Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it. | Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\ndecompose review | Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. | Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose compile | Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. | Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\ndecompose status | none | Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose impact | none | Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose import | Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required. | Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\nsetup decompose | Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime. | Usage: taskspec setup decompose","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5b797ae4-2efc-430c-9d86-23005f3cd343","uuid":"0492cb52-5b37-456c-8175-a27f1434a056","timestamp":"2026-10-14T19:44:07.375Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"example | writes one installed canonical example non-clobberingly; --force replaces and --dry-run writes nothing | Usage: taskspec example task-plan --out <file> [--force]\nnew | creates one Task-Spec scaffold and derived state | Usage: taskspec new [--format 3|4] [--status ready|blocked] [--queue] <slug> <XS|S|M|L|XL|XXL> [agent] [source-note]\nplan | none | Usage: taskspec plan --manifest <TaskPlan.yaml>\nbatch | creates declared Task-Spec scaffolds; --dry-run writes nothing | Usage: taskspec batch --plan <TaskPlan.yaml> | taskspec batch --intent-file <file> --effort <size>\ngate | executes task evals; --stamp additionally writes the sign-off envelope | Usage: taskspec gate [--stamp] [--require-tier1] <task-spec>\naccept | executes acceptance evals; --stamp additionally writes AcceptanceRecord/v1 and the acceptance envelope | Usage: taskspec accept [--stamp] [--handoff <file>] [receipt flags] <task-spec>\nstatus | none; emits TaskStatus/v1 and exactly one safe next command | Usage: taskspec status <task-id-or-path> [--json] | taskspec status --initiative <id>\ndecompose | Native intent decomposition, signed topology review, and TaskPlan compilation. | Usage: taskspec decompose init|prepare|review|compile|status|impact|import <initiative> [options]\ndecompose init | Create explicit intent workspace. | Usage: taskspec decompose init <initiative> --intent-file <file|->\ndecompose prepare | Validate and project an authored recipe; never approve it. | Usage: taskspec decompose prepare <initiative> --recipe <file> [--replace]\ndecompose review | Authenticate explicit approval of the current topology. | Usage: taskspec decompose review <initiative> --accept --reviewer <name> --reason <text>\ndecompose compile | Compile reviewed topology and lineage without sealing leaves. | Usage: taskspec decompose compile <initiative>\ndecompose status | none | Usage: taskspec decompose status <initiative>\ndecompose impact | none | Usage: taskspec decompose impact <initiative> --against <bundle-or-snapshot.json>\ndecompose import | Explicitly import originals; fresh native review required. | Usage: taskspec decompose import <initiative> --source <workspace>\nsetup decompose | Provision locked dependencies in the private runtime. | Usage: taskspec setup decompose","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
